    "adaptations": "Foundation: short distance, walking pace, wide target. Intermediate: full pace and one decision. Advanced: time, precision, or complex sequence. Large group: six lanes. Small: pairs. Limited space: short stations. Partial equipment: share in pairs. Varied needs: visual mark, extra time, fixed partner, adapted range.",
