    "bankLink": "Tags: athletics, multi-event circuit, stations, effort regulation, school PE.\nSport: Athletics. Age: 12–15. Equipment: cones, floor marks, batons, soft balls, mats, tape.\nSkills: running technique, jumping technique, throwing technique, effort regulation, independent transitions, self-recording.\nLoad: moderate. Complexity: intermediate.\nKeywords: multi-event circuit, cue cards, station rotation, technique under fatigue, self-recording, transition signal, quality before speed.",
